  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner Capacity building - Drought Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall Drought and Food Crisis in Horn and East Africa has severaly affected the poorest espaecially in marginal and agro-pastoral regions of kenya, Ethiopia , Uganda, is seeking to alleviate suffering among the population hardest hit by the current drought in Kenya, Tanzania, Ethiopia and Uganda. It will improve access to emergency food relief, safe water and sanitation facilities, fodder and water for livestock. With this extensive response, there is need to enhance partners&#x2019; capacity and make them more able to respond to the current food crisis arises.</narrative>
  </description>
